[
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.251",
    "end": "00:00:06.920",
    "start_seconds": 4.251,
    "end_seconds": 6.92,
    "text": "Let's get the obvious out of the way first, shall we?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:06.962",
    "end": "00:00:08.880",
    "start_seconds": 6.962,
    "end_seconds": 8.88,
    "text": "Yes, I'm British."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:08.922",
    "end": "00:00:10.674",
    "start_seconds": 8.922,
    "end_seconds": 10.674,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:10.715",
    "end": "00:00:13.760",
    "start_seconds": 10.715,
    "end_seconds": 13.76,
    "text": "And yes, I'm here talking to Americans about democracy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13.802",
    "end": "00:00:20.016",
    "start_seconds": 13.802,
    "end_seconds": 20.016,
    "text": "on the eve of the 250th anniversary of the Declaration of Independence"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.058",
    "end": "00:00:21.393",
    "start_seconds": 20.058,
    "end_seconds": 21.393,
    "text": "from Britain."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:21.393",
    "end": "00:00:23.895",
    "start_seconds": 21.393,
    "end_seconds": 23.895,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:24.521",
    "end": "00:00:27.107",
    "start_seconds": 24.521,
    "end_seconds": 27.107,
    "text": "I'm very tempted to chuck my talk out of the window"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:27.148",
    "end": "00:00:29.484",
    "start_seconds": 27.148,
    "end_seconds": 29.484,
    "text": "and break into King George from \"Hamilton.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.526",
    "end": "00:00:30.777",
    "start_seconds": 29.526,
    "end_seconds": 30.777,
    "text": "\"You'll be back.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:30.777",
    "end": "00:00:33.655",
    "start_seconds": 30.777,
    "end_seconds": 33.655,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33.655",
    "end": "00:00:36.616",
    "start_seconds": 33.655,
    "end_seconds": 36.616,
    "text": "But I'm not here to call you back."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:36.658",
    "end": "00:00:39.119",
    "start_seconds": 36.658,
    "end_seconds": 39.119,
    "text": "I'm here to call all of us forward,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:39.119",
    "end": "00:00:41.871",
    "start_seconds": 39.119,
    "end_seconds": 41.871,
    "text": "because I've spent the last ten years gathering stories"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:41.913",
    "end": "00:00:44.791",
    "start_seconds": 41.913,
    "end_seconds": 44.791,
    "text": "from around the world of the future of democracy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.791",
    "end": "00:00:46.001",
    "start_seconds": 44.791,
    "end_seconds": 46.001,
    "text": "for my book \"Citizens\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.042",
    "end": "00:00:49.421",
    "start_seconds": 46.042,
    "end_seconds": 49.421,
    "text": "and for the podcast I co-host, \"How to Save Democracy.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49.963",
    "end": "00:00:52.507",
    "start_seconds": 49.963,
    "end_seconds": 52.507,
    "text": "And what I've found are a couple of things."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:53.174",
    "end": "00:00:55.677",
    "start_seconds": 53.174,
    "end_seconds": 55.677,
    "text": "The first is that there is a bold, bright,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:55.677",
    "end": "00:00:58.972",
    "start_seconds": 55.677,
    "end_seconds": 58.972,
    "text": "beautiful future of democracy just wanting to take hold."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:59.014",
    "end": "00:01:03.226",
    "start_seconds": 59.014,
    "end_seconds": 63.226,
    "text": "It's emerging everywhere in institutions that are open and participatory,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:03.226",
    "end": "00:01:05.353",
    "start_seconds": 63.226,
    "end_seconds": 65.353,
    "text": "and in politicians who are desperate"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.395",
    "end": "00:01:08.982",
    "start_seconds": 65.395,
    "end_seconds": 68.982,
    "text": "to put the power of citizens ahead of their own power."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:08.982",
    "end": "00:01:10.609",
    "start_seconds": 68.982,
    "end_seconds": 70.609,
    "text": "But what I want to focus on today"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.650",
    "end": "00:01:14.571",
    "start_seconds": 70.65,
    "end_seconds": 74.571,
    "text": "is not so much that destination, as the journey to get there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:15.155",
    "end": "00:01:17.240",
    "start_seconds": 75.155,
    "end_seconds": 77.24,
    "text": "Because what I've seen all over the world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:17.282",
    "end": "00:01:20.368",
    "start_seconds": 77.282,
    "end_seconds": 80.368,
    "text": "is that it's actually not institutions that are changing for us."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:20.410",
    "end": "00:01:23.371",
    "start_seconds": 80.41,
    "end_seconds": 83.371,
    "text": "It's not politicians who are leading us there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.413",
    "end": "00:01:24.873",
    "start_seconds": 83.413,
    "end_seconds": 84.873,
    "text": "It's the people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.914",
    "end": "00:01:28.877",
    "start_seconds": 84.914,
    "end_seconds": 88.877,
    "text": "It's citizens coming together and building the future,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:28.918",
    "end": "00:01:32.380",
    "start_seconds": 88.918,
    "end_seconds": 92.38,
    "text": "creating the space for the politics to move into."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:32.964",
    "end": "00:01:37.469",
    "start_seconds": 92.964,
    "end_seconds": 97.469,
    "text": "Because the line I want to leave you with at the end of all of this,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:37.469",
    "end": "00:01:39.596",
    "start_seconds": 97.469,
    "end_seconds": 99.596,
    "text": "democracy is not something we have."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:39.971",
    "end": "00:01:41.973",
    "start_seconds": 99.971,
    "end_seconds": 101.973,
    "text": "It's something we have to build."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:42.349",
    "end": "00:01:44.893",
    "start_seconds": 102.34899999999999,
    "end_seconds": 104.893,
    "text": "Now, my favorite story of this new democracy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.934",
    "end": "00:01:47.020",
    "start_seconds": 104.934,
    "end_seconds": 107.02000000000001,
    "text": "comes from Melbourne in Australia,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.062",
    "end": "00:01:49.397",
    "start_seconds": 107.062,
    "end_seconds": 109.39699999999999,
    "text": "and it starts at the end of 2020."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:50.398",
    "end": "00:01:52.317",
    "start_seconds": 110.398,
    "end_seconds": 112.31700000000001,
    "text": "In the context of COVID lockdowns"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:52.359",
    "end": "00:01:56.029",
    "start_seconds": 112.35900000000001,
    "end_seconds": 116.029,
    "text": "and black summer bush fires raging across Victoria"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:56.071",
    "end": "00:01:58.114",
    "start_seconds": 116.071,
    "end_seconds": 118.114,
    "text": "and clogging the city with smoke,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:58.156",
    "end": "00:02:01.201",
    "start_seconds": 118.156,
    "end_seconds": 121.201,
    "text": "Melburnians were confined to quarters for weeks on end."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:01.951",
    "end": "00:02:05.747",
    "start_seconds": 121.951,
    "end_seconds": 125.747,
    "text": "In that context, a few citizens started to gather online."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:06.373",
    "end": "00:02:08.291",
    "start_seconds": 126.373,
    "end_seconds": 128.291,
    "text": "They were motivated by the understanding"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:08.333",
    "end": "00:02:11.252",
    "start_seconds": 128.333,
    "end_seconds": 131.252,
    "text": "that the existing power structures just weren't capable"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:11.294",
    "end": "00:02:13.713",
    "start_seconds": 131.294,
    "end_seconds": 133.713,
    "text": "of responding to these challenges."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.755",
    "end": "00:02:16.633",
    "start_seconds": 133.755,
    "end_seconds": 136.633,
    "text": "And if they didn't want this to be the pattern of the summers"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:16.633",
    "end": "00:02:18.009",
    "start_seconds": 136.633,
    "end_seconds": 138.00900000000001,
    "text": "for the rest of their lives,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.051",
    "end": "00:02:20.929",
    "start_seconds": 138.051,
    "end_seconds": 140.929,
    "text": "they were going to have to lean in and do something about it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:20.929",
    "end": "00:02:23.682",
    "start_seconds": 140.929,
    "end_seconds": 143.682,
    "text": "Soon, those few citizens were joined by a few more,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:23.682",
    "end": "00:02:27.936",
    "start_seconds": 143.682,
    "end_seconds": 147.936,
    "text": "and then tens and eventually hundreds of people were attending these calls."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.937",
    "end": "00:02:32.232",
    "start_seconds": 148.937,
    "end_seconds": 152.232,
    "text": "They invited authors and experts from around the world to inform them,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:32.232",
    "end": "00:02:33.775",
    "start_seconds": 152.232,
    "end_seconds": 153.775,
    "text": "as they tried to create a vision"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:33.775",
    "end": "00:02:36.403",
    "start_seconds": 153.775,
    "end_seconds": 156.403,
    "text": "for the future of the city that they wanted to hold."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:37.195",
    "end": "00:02:39.406",
    "start_seconds": 157.195,
    "end_seconds": 159.406,
    "text": "They got to this point where they were saying,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.406",
    "end": "00:02:43.702",
    "start_seconds": 159.406,
    "end_seconds": 163.702,
    "text": "we believe we can create a resilient, regenerative, beautiful city"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:43.743",
    "end": "00:02:46.496",
    "start_seconds": 163.743,
    "end_seconds": 166.496,
    "text": "in a way that can be a template for others to follow."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:47.205",
    "end": "00:02:50.542",
    "start_seconds": 167.20499999999998,
    "end_seconds": 170.542,
    "text": "They birthed an organization called Regen Melbourne"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:50.542",
    "end": "00:02:53.545",
    "start_seconds": 170.542,
    "end_seconds": 173.54500000000002,
    "text": "to act as a catalyst for citizen activity,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:53.545",
    "end": "00:02:57.382",
    "start_seconds": 173.54500000000002,
    "end_seconds": 177.382,
    "text": "and they aligned their work around three earthshot goals."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.382",
    "end": "00:03:01.511",
    "start_seconds": 177.382,
    "end_seconds": 181.511,
    "text": "The first was to make the River Birrarung swimmable for its entire course."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:01.970",
    "end": "00:03:04.389",
    "start_seconds": 181.97,
    "end_seconds": 184.389,
    "text": "The second to localize the city's food system"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.389",
    "end": "00:03:08.268",
    "start_seconds": 184.389,
    "end_seconds": 188.268,
    "text": "so that every one of its neighborhoods would be a nourished neighborhood."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.309",
    "end": "00:03:11.521",
    "start_seconds": 188.309,
    "end_seconds": 191.52100000000002,
    "text": "And the third was to foster a sense of community"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.563",
    "end": "00:03:14.649",
    "start_seconds": 191.563,
    "end_seconds": 194.649,
    "text": "on every one of the city's 300,000 streets,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:14.691",
    "end": "00:03:18.862",
    "start_seconds": 194.691,
    "end_seconds": 198.862,
    "text": "partly because if these situations were to repeat themselves,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.903",
    "end": "00:03:20.613",
    "start_seconds": 198.903,
    "end_seconds": 200.613,
    "text": "then that's what would be needed,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:20.613",
    "end": "00:03:22.991",
    "start_seconds": 200.613,
    "end_seconds": 202.99099999999999,
    "text": "but more because -- joy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24.826",
    "end": "00:03:26.494",
    "start_seconds": 204.826,
    "end_seconds": 206.494,
    "text": "Five years on,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:26.494",
    "end": "00:03:30.123",
    "start_seconds": 206.494,
    "end_seconds": 210.123,
    "text": "there's been amazing progress and in fascinating ways."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.790",
    "end": "00:03:34.294",
    "start_seconds": 210.79,
    "end_seconds": 214.29399999999998,
    "text": "Citizens are jumping into the Birrarung ever closer to the sea"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.335",
    "end": "00:03:36.045",
    "start_seconds": 214.335,
    "end_seconds": 216.04500000000002,
    "text": "at river festivals."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.087",
    "end": "00:03:39.299",
    "start_seconds": 216.087,
    "end_seconds": 219.299,
    "text": "The river has status as a living entity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.299",
    "end": "00:03:40.842",
    "start_seconds": 219.299,
    "end_seconds": 220.84199999999998,
    "text": "And rights."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.342",
    "end": "00:03:44.220",
    "start_seconds": 221.34199999999998,
    "end_seconds": 224.22,
    "text": "But most interestingly of all, on that goal,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.262",
    "end": "00:03:49.225",
    "start_seconds": 224.262,
    "end_seconds": 229.225,
    "text": "the City Council has come in behind and adopted the goal with the citizens."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:49.267",
    "end": "00:03:52.270",
    "start_seconds": 229.267,
    "end_seconds": 232.27,
    "text": "And now institutional resources are starting to flow."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:52.312",
    "end": "00:03:55.523",
    "start_seconds": 232.312,
    "end_seconds": 235.523,
    "text": "They've created the space for the politics to move into."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.899",
    "end": "00:03:58.401",
    "start_seconds": 235.899,
    "end_seconds": 238.401,
    "text": "There's been similar progress on the other goals,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:58.443",
    "end": "00:04:00.403",
    "start_seconds": 238.44299999999998,
    "end_seconds": 240.403,
    "text": "and now there are even conversations"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.445",
    "end": "00:04:03.239",
    "start_seconds": 240.445,
    "end_seconds": 243.239,
    "text": "about even more ambitious projects that they could take on."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:03.281",
    "end": "00:04:06.284",
    "start_seconds": 243.281,
    "end_seconds": 246.284,
    "text": "There's talk of creating a standing citizens assembly"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.326",
    "end": "00:04:08.369",
    "start_seconds": 246.326,
    "end_seconds": 248.369,
    "text": "as part of the city's governance structure."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:08.411",
    "end": "00:04:11.831",
    "start_seconds": 248.411,
    "end_seconds": 251.831,
    "text": "Randomly selected citizens, a representative sample of them,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:11.831",
    "end": "00:04:14.542",
    "start_seconds": 251.831,
    "end_seconds": 254.542,
    "text": "to debate and discuss the key issues facing the city"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:14.584",
    "end": "00:04:17.712",
    "start_seconds": 254.584,
    "end_seconds": 257.712,
    "text": "as a complement to the existing elected systems."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.713",
    "end": "00:04:22.217",
    "start_seconds": 258.713,
    "end_seconds": 262.217,
    "text": "There are sister organizations springing up all over Australia."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:22.258",
    "end": "00:04:24.427",
    "start_seconds": 262.258,
    "end_seconds": 264.427,
    "text": "The momentum is building hugely"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.427",
    "end": "00:04:28.765",
    "start_seconds": 264.427,
    "end_seconds": 268.765,
    "text": "and it all started with a few citizens coming together online,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.765",
    "end": "00:04:31.226",
    "start_seconds": 268.765,
    "end_seconds": 271.226,
    "text": "not staring into crisis"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:31.226",
    "end": "00:04:32.936",
    "start_seconds": 271.226,
    "end_seconds": 272.936,
    "text": "but building out of it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.478",
    "end": "00:04:36.231",
    "start_seconds": 273.478,
    "end_seconds": 276.231,
    "text": "Now look, there are so many stories I want to tell you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:36.231",
    "end": "00:04:37.732",
    "start_seconds": 276.231,
    "end_seconds": 277.73199999999997,
    "text": "I want another hour."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:37.774",
    "end": "00:04:39.234",
    "start_seconds": 277.774,
    "end_seconds": 279.234,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:39.234",
    "end": "00:04:42.946",
    "start_seconds": 279.234,
    "end_seconds": 282.946,
    "text": "I want to tell you about Taiwan's crowdsourced COVID response"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:42.946",
    "end": "00:04:45.490",
    "start_seconds": 282.946,
    "end_seconds": 285.49,
    "text": "that was rooted in a set of digital tools"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:45.490",
    "end": "00:04:48.493",
    "start_seconds": 285.49,
    "end_seconds": 288.493,
    "text": "that a citizen movement came together and built."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.118",
    "end": "00:04:50.703",
    "start_seconds": 289.118,
    "end_seconds": 290.703,
    "text": "I want to tell you about Ireland,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.703",
    "end": "00:04:54.457",
    "start_seconds": 290.703,
    "end_seconds": 294.457,
    "text": "where there's a citizens assembly as part of the national governance structure"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.457",
    "end": "00:04:58.044",
    "start_seconds": 294.457,
    "end_seconds": 298.044,
    "text": "that has helped them resolve some of the most polarizing issues of our time"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:58.086",
    "end": "00:05:00.755",
    "start_seconds": 298.086,
    "end_seconds": 300.755,
    "text": "in a way that brought the nation together,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:00.797",
    "end": "00:05:03.466",
    "start_seconds": 300.797,
    "end_seconds": 303.466,
    "text": "and that the first iteration of that assembly"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:03.466",
    "end": "00:05:04.926",
    "start_seconds": 303.466,
    "end_seconds": 304.926,
    "text": "citizens built it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:06.928",
    "end": "00:05:08.471",
    "start_seconds": 306.928,
    "end_seconds": 308.471,
    "text": "I want to tell you about things"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:08.471",
    "end": "00:05:11.724",
    "start_seconds": 308.471,
    "end_seconds": 311.724,
    "text": "that are happening all over the world and all over America as well,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:11.766",
    "end": "00:05:13.017",
    "start_seconds": 311.766,
    "end_seconds": 313.017,
    "text": "in Lexington, Kentucky,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:13.059",
    "end": "00:05:14.352",
    "start_seconds": 313.059,
    "end_seconds": 314.352,
    "text": "and Fort Collins, Colorado,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:14.394",
    "end": "00:05:16.062",
    "start_seconds": 314.394,
    "end_seconds": 316.062,
    "text": "and I don't have time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:17.689",
    "end": "00:05:19.440",
    "start_seconds": 317.689,
    "end_seconds": 319.44,
    "text": "But what I can tell you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:19.482",
    "end": "00:05:21.860",
    "start_seconds": 319.48199999999997,
    "end_seconds": 321.86,
    "text": "is that there is something big going on."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:21.901",
    "end": "00:05:24.904",
    "start_seconds": 321.901,
    "end_seconds": 324.904,
    "text": "And I think the best way to understand it"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:24.946",
    "end": "00:05:29.033",
    "start_seconds": 324.946,
    "end_seconds": 329.033,
    "text": "is through the lens of what I call stories of self and society."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:29.617",
    "end": "00:05:31.619",
    "start_seconds": 329.617,
    "end_seconds": 331.619,
    "text": "And this is a framework I want to offer you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:31.661",
    "end": "00:05:34.539",
    "start_seconds": 331.661,
    "end_seconds": 334.539,
    "text": "as a way of understanding the moment in time we're living in."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:34.539",
    "end": "00:05:37.625",
    "start_seconds": 334.539,
    "end_seconds": 337.625,
    "text": "Back in the days of the old country,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:37.667",
    "end": "00:05:39.836",
    "start_seconds": 337.66700000000003,
    "end_seconds": 339.836,
    "text": "we lived in what I call the subject story,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:39.878",
    "end": "00:05:41.546",
    "start_seconds": 339.878,
    "end_seconds": 341.546,
    "text": "as in subjects of the king."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:41.546",
    "end": "00:05:43.715",
    "start_seconds": 341.546,
    "end_seconds": 343.71500000000003,
    "text": "The right thing to do was keep your head down,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:43.756",
    "end": "00:05:45.758",
    "start_seconds": 343.756,
    "end_seconds": 345.758,
    "text": "do as you're told, get what you're given,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:45.758",
    "end": "00:05:46.968",
    "start_seconds": 345.758,
    "end_seconds": 346.968,
    "text": "on the basis"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:46.968",
    "end": "00:05:48.595",
    "start_seconds": 346.968,
    "end_seconds": 348.595,
    "text": "that the God-given few knew best,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:48.595",
    "end": "00:05:51.764",
    "start_seconds": 348.595,
    "end_seconds": 351.764,
    "text": "and they would lead us to the best outcomes for society as a whole."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:51.764",
    "end": "00:05:53.057",
    "start_seconds": 351.764,
    "end_seconds": 353.057,
    "text": "You'll be back, remember?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:53.057",
    "end": "00:05:54.225",
    "start_seconds": 353.057,
    "end_seconds": 354.225,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:54.767",
    "end": "00:05:58.897",
    "start_seconds": 354.767,
    "end_seconds": 358.897,
    "text": "Coming out of the two world wars, America gave us the consumer story."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:58.897",
    "end": "00:06:01.399",
    "start_seconds": 358.897,
    "end_seconds": 361.399,
    "text": "The right thing to do now was to pursue self-interest"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:01.399",
    "end": "00:06:04.861",
    "start_seconds": 361.399,
    "end_seconds": 364.861,
    "text": "on the basis that self-interest would add up to the collective interest,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:04.903",
    "end": "00:06:07.113",
    "start_seconds": 364.903,
    "end_seconds": 367.113,
    "text": "that that's how the best society would result."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:07.113",
    "end": "00:06:09.324",
    "start_seconds": 367.113,
    "end_seconds": 369.324,
    "text": "With that came a kind of democracy,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:09.324",
    "end": "00:06:12.869",
    "start_seconds": 369.324,
    "end_seconds": 372.869,
    "text": "a democracy where we could express our choice every few years,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:12.869",
    "end": "00:06:14.704",
    "start_seconds": 372.869,
    "end_seconds": 374.704,
    "text": "choose between a fixed set of options"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:14.704",
    "end": "00:06:18.875",
    "start_seconds": 374.704,
    "end_seconds": 378.875,
    "text": "as to who to give our power to on the basis of self-interest."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:19.542",
    "end": "00:06:20.752",
    "start_seconds": 379.54200000000003,
    "end_seconds": 380.752,
    "text": "And it seemed to work."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:20.752",
    "end": "00:06:23.046",
    "start_seconds": 380.752,
    "end_seconds": 383.046,
    "text": "It was a liberating shift from what came before."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:23.087",
    "end": "00:06:26.633",
    "start_seconds": 383.087,
    "end_seconds": 386.633,
    "text": "But now we can't solve the challenges of our time from within that logic,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:26.633",
    "end": "00:06:29.594",
    "start_seconds": 386.633,
    "end_seconds": 389.594,
    "text": "you can't solve loneliness and mental ill-health"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:29.636",
    "end": "00:06:31.763",
    "start_seconds": 389.636,
    "end_seconds": 391.763,
    "text": "from within a logic of self-interest."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:31.804",
    "end": "00:06:35.934",
    "start_seconds": 391.804,
    "end_seconds": 395.93399999999997,
    "text": "You can't solve pervasive inequality from within a logic of self-interest."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:35.934",
    "end": "00:06:40.480",
    "start_seconds": 395.93399999999997,
    "end_seconds": 400.48,
    "text": "And we can't solve ecological crises from within a logic of self-interest."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:41.940",
    "end": "00:06:43.399",
    "start_seconds": 401.94,
    "end_seconds": 403.399,
    "text": "As that story collapses,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:43.441",
    "end": "00:06:45.777",
    "start_seconds": 403.44100000000003,
    "end_seconds": 405.777,
    "text": "my way of understanding what is going on right now"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:45.818",
    "end": "00:06:48.363",
    "start_seconds": 405.818,
    "end_seconds": 408.363,
    "text": "is that the subjects story is back in the uncertainty,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:48.404",
    "end": "00:06:52.617",
    "start_seconds": 408.404,
    "end_seconds": 412.617,
    "text": "with strong men leaders offering false certainties into that chaos."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:52.659",
    "end": "00:06:54.494",
    "start_seconds": 412.659,
    "end_seconds": 414.494,
    "text": "But there is another option."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:54.535",
    "end": "00:06:57.789",
    "start_seconds": 414.53499999999997,
    "end_seconds": 417.789,
    "text": "To step forward into what I call the citizen story."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:57.830",
    "end": "00:07:00.667",
    "start_seconds": 417.83,
    "end_seconds": 420.667,
    "text": "The logic here isn't keep your head down, do as you're told,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:00.667",
    "end": "00:07:02.168",
    "start_seconds": 420.667,
    "end_seconds": 422.168,
    "text": "nor is it pursue self-interest."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:02.168",
    "end": "00:07:03.378",
    "start_seconds": 422.168,
    "end_seconds": 423.378,
    "text": "It's get involved."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:03.419",
    "end": "00:07:05.630",
    "start_seconds": 423.419,
    "end_seconds": 425.63,
    "text": "Contribute your ideas and energy and resources."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:05.672",
    "end": "00:07:08.424",
    "start_seconds": 425.672,
    "end_seconds": 428.424,
    "text": "Come together with others and build it"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:08.466",
    "end": "00:07:11.594",
    "start_seconds": 428.466,
    "end_seconds": 431.594,
    "text": "on the basis that all of us are smarter than any of us."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:11.594",
    "end": "00:07:13.972",
    "start_seconds": 431.594,
    "end_seconds": 433.972,
    "text": "And that's how the best society will result."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:14.514",
    "end": "00:07:17.475",
    "start_seconds": 434.514,
    "end_seconds": 437.475,
    "text": "And then there is Altadena, California."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:17.517",
    "end": "00:07:18.851",
    "start_seconds": 437.517,
    "end_seconds": 438.851,
    "text": "I get one more story."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:18.893",
    "end": "00:07:20.019",
    "start_seconds": 438.89300000000003,
    "end_seconds": 440.019,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:20.645",
    "end": "00:07:22.397",
    "start_seconds": 440.645,
    "end_seconds": 442.397,
    "text": "On January 25,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:22.438",
    "end": "00:07:26.067",
    "start_seconds": 442.438,
    "end_seconds": 446.067,
    "text": "the Eaton Fire tore through Altadena."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:26.109",
    "end": "00:07:27.819",
    "start_seconds": 446.109,
    "end_seconds": 447.819,
    "text": "Whole neighborhoods were destroyed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:27.860",
    "end": "00:07:31.030",
    "start_seconds": 447.86,
    "end_seconds": 451.03,
    "text": "This historically significant Black and brown community"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:31.072",
    "end": "00:07:32.740",
    "start_seconds": 451.072,
    "end_seconds": 452.74,
    "text": "burned to the ground."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:33.491",
    "end": "00:07:34.993",
    "start_seconds": 453.491,
    "end_seconds": 454.993,
    "text": "In that context,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:35.034",
    "end": "00:07:39.080",
    "start_seconds": 455.034,
    "end_seconds": 459.08,
    "text": "what happened was that the citizens of Altadena came together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:39.914",
    "end": "00:07:41.332",
    "start_seconds": 459.914,
    "end_seconds": 461.332,
    "text": "Even though they had nothing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:41.374",
    "end": "00:07:45.086",
    "start_seconds": 461.374,
    "end_seconds": 465.086,
    "text": "they came together to decide what to do with what little they had."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:45.086",
    "end": "00:07:48.339",
    "start_seconds": 465.086,
    "end_seconds": 468.339,
    "text": "Neighbors helping neighbors, giving and getting given."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:48.339",
    "end": "00:07:50.383",
    "start_seconds": 468.339,
    "end_seconds": 470.383,
    "text": "They created Dena Heals,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:50.383",
    "end": "00:07:53.386",
    "start_seconds": 470.383,
    "end_seconds": 473.386,
    "text": "a mutual-aid marketplace and wellness center"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:53.386",
    "end": "00:07:57.724",
    "start_seconds": 473.386,
    "end_seconds": 477.724,
    "text": "that has since helped over 7,000 people from 1,500 families."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:58.391",
    "end": "00:08:01.144",
    "start_seconds": 478.391,
    "end_seconds": 481.144,
    "text": "And what I know from what I've seen around the world,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:01.185",
    "end": "00:08:04.772",
    "start_seconds": 481.185,
    "end_seconds": 484.772,
    "text": "is that this is what happens when crisis hits everywhere."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:04.814",
    "end": "00:08:07.942",
    "start_seconds": 484.814,
    "end_seconds": 487.942,
    "text": "Dena Heals is just a particularly beautiful example"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:07.942",
    "end": "00:08:10.611",
    "start_seconds": 487.942,
    "end_seconds": 490.611,
    "text": "of what is a deeply human response to crisis."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:11.195",
    "end": "00:08:14.866",
    "start_seconds": 491.195,
    "end_seconds": 494.866,
    "text": "To let the barriers that have kept us apart burn"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:14.866",
    "end": "00:08:17.243",
    "start_seconds": 494.866,
    "end_seconds": 497.243,
    "text": "rather than our relationships."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:17.952",
    "end": "00:08:20.204",
    "start_seconds": 497.952,
    "end_seconds": 500.204,
    "text": "We come together in that moment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:20.204",
    "end": "00:08:22.999",
    "start_seconds": 500.204,
    "end_seconds": 502.999,
    "text": "And Dena Heals isn't charity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:22.999",
    "end": "00:08:24.834",
    "start_seconds": 502.999,
    "end_seconds": 504.834,
    "text": "It isn't even kindness."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:24.876",
    "end": "00:08:26.669",
    "start_seconds": 504.876,
    "end_seconds": 506.669,
    "text": "It's actually democracy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:27.086",
    "end": "00:08:30.131",
    "start_seconds": 507.086,
    "end_seconds": 510.131,
    "text": "People coming together to build what they need."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:31.507",
    "end": "00:08:33.843",
    "start_seconds": 511.507,
    "end_seconds": 513.843,
    "text": "This is what we will do in times of crisis."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:34.260",
    "end": "00:08:37.722",
    "start_seconds": 514.26,
    "end_seconds": 517.722,
    "text": "But it would be so much easier if we start building now."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:39.265",
    "end": "00:08:41.392",
    "start_seconds": 519.265,
    "end_seconds": 521.392,
    "text": "So here's what I want to leave you with."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:41.434",
    "end": "00:08:43.978",
    "start_seconds": 521.434,
    "end_seconds": 523.978,
    "text": "The first three words of the US Constitution"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:43.978",
    "end": "00:08:47.648",
    "start_seconds": 523.978,
    "end_seconds": 527.648,
    "text": "really tell the whole story, written just a little way from here."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:47.690",
    "end": "00:08:49.150",
    "start_seconds": 527.69,
    "end_seconds": 529.15,
    "text": "We the people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:49.692",
    "end": "00:08:52.820",
    "start_seconds": 529.692,
    "end_seconds": 532.82,
    "text": "Because democracy isn't something that is done for us"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:52.820",
    "end": "00:08:56.032",
    "start_seconds": 532.82,
    "end_seconds": 536.032,
    "text": "by institutions or by politicians,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:56.032",
    "end": "00:08:57.784",
    "start_seconds": 536.032,
    "end_seconds": 537.784,
    "text": "it's something we do,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:57.825",
    "end": "00:08:59.619",
    "start_seconds": 537.825,
    "end_seconds": 539.619,
    "text": "something we have to build."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:00.119",
    "end": "00:09:03.247",
    "start_seconds": 540.119,
    "end_seconds": 543.247,
    "text": "In this moment in time, we all have agency."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:04.123",
    "end": "00:09:07.251",
    "start_seconds": 544.123,
    "end_seconds": 547.251,
    "text": "And it starts very simply, on a Monday morning"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:07.293",
    "end": "00:09:10.254",
    "start_seconds": 547.293,
    "end_seconds": 550.254,
    "text": "when you get back to your places where you live and love,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:10.254",
    "end": "00:09:13.341",
    "start_seconds": 550.254,
    "end_seconds": 553.341,
    "text": "go for a walk, think about what you care about."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:13.341",
    "end": "00:09:15.593",
    "start_seconds": 553.341,
    "end_seconds": 555.593,
    "text": "Think about who else cares about it too."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:15.593",
    "end": "00:09:19.514",
    "start_seconds": 555.593,
    "end_seconds": 559.514,
    "text": "Think about how you might gather and what you might build."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:19.555",
    "end": "00:09:22.934",
    "start_seconds": 559.555,
    "end_seconds": 562.934,
    "text": "The future isn't going to be made tidy for us."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:22.975",
    "end": "00:09:26.104",
    "start_seconds": 562.975,
    "end_seconds": 566.104,
    "text": "We're going to live through dark and dangerous times."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:26.604",
    "end": "00:09:29.690",
    "start_seconds": 566.604,
    "end_seconds": 569.69,
    "text": "And it won't be delivered for us as consumers."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:29.690",
    "end": "00:09:32.652",
    "start_seconds": 569.69,
    "end_seconds": 572.652,
    "text": "But it doesn’t have to be done to us as subjects, either,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:33.319",
    "end": "00:09:37.073",
    "start_seconds": 573.319,
    "end_seconds": 577.073,
    "text": "if we come together and build as citizens."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:37.824",
    "end": "00:09:39.033",
    "start_seconds": 577.824,
    "end_seconds": 579.033,
    "text": "So let's build."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:39.367",
    "end": "00:09:40.535",
    "start_seconds": 579.367,
    "end_seconds": 580.535,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:40.535",
    "end": "00:09:44.497",
    "start_seconds": 580.535,
    "end_seconds": 584.497,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  }
]
